---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Container from '@/src/components/ui/container.astro';
import Grid from '@/src/components/ui/grid.astro';
import Typography from '@/src/components/ui/typography.astro';
import Separator from '@/src/components/ui/separator.astro';
---

<Base title="Get Started" description="Two commands. Your agents start learning immediately.">

  <section class="hero-section">
    <Container size="5xl" padding="6">
      <Container gap="4">
        <Typography as="h1" variant="h1">Two commands. Your agents start learning immediately.</Typography>
        <Typography as="p" variant="lead"><em>No accounts. No API keys. No cloud services.</em></Typography>
        <Typography as="p" variant="muted">You need Claude Code on a Max plan. That's it.</Typography>
      </Container>
    </Container>
  </section>

  <Container size="5xl" padding="6">

    <!-- Step 1 -->
    <div class="step-card">
      <div class="step-badge cyan-badge">1</div>
      <div class="step-visual">
        <pre><code><span class="p">$</span> /plugin marketplace add runlegion/legion
<span class="o">Added runlegion/legion to marketplace.</span>

<span class="p">$</span> /plugin install legion
<span class="o">Installed legion v0.3.0
  Hooks:    6 registered
  Commands: 13 available
  Channel:  legion-channel connected
  Skills:   4 loaded</span></code></pre>
      </div>
      <div class="step-bar bar-cyan"></div>
      <div class="step-content">
        <h2 class="step-title">Install</h2>
        <p class="step-quote"><em>"Two lines in Claude Code. Everything you need."</em></p>
        <p class="step-prose">Open Claude Code. Run these two commands. Legion is now installed. Your next coding session has persistent memory, team coordination, and auto-wake. Nothing else to configure.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Step 2 -->
    <div class="step-card">
      <div class="step-badge cyan-badge">2</div>
      <div class="step-visual">
        <pre><code><span class="p">$</span> legion reflect --repo myapp \
    --text "Auth middleware must run
     before rate limiting. Order matters."
<span class="o">Reflection stored: 019a7b2c...</span>

<span class="p">$</span> legion recall --repo myapp
<span class="o">1 reflection found.
  "Auth middleware must run before..."</span></code></pre>
      </div>
      <div class="step-bar bar-cyan"></div>
      <div class="step-content">
        <h2 class="step-title">Day 1</h2>
        <h3 class="step-subtitle">Your agent starts remembering</h3>
        <p class="step-quote"><em>"Every session ends with a reflection. Every reflection is context it didn't have before."</em></p>
        <p class="step-prose">At the end of every session, legion asks your agent what it learned. Next session, the agent recalls those reflections before it starts working. It stops making the same mistakes. It starts applying patterns it discovered yesterday.</p>
        <div class="step-columns">
          <div>
            <span class="col-label text-primary">What happens</span>
            <ul class="col-list">
              <li>Agent reflects after each task</li>
              <li>Reflections indexed and searchable</li>
              <li>Auto-recalled on session start</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div>
            <span class="col-label">Expect</span>
            <ul class="col-list">
              <li>Mistakes early</li>
              <li>You're still correcting it</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Step 3 -->
    <div class="step-card">
      <div class="step-badge green-badge">3</div>
      <div class="step-visual">
        <pre><code><span class="p">$</span> legion consult --context "auth middleware"
<span class="o">3 reflections across 2 repos:

  [myapp] "Auth middleware must run
           before rate limiting..."
  [api]   "Token refresh uses sliding
           window, not fixed expiry..."
  [myapp] "Rate limiter reads auth
           context for per-user limits..."</span></code></pre>
      </div>
      <div class="step-bar bar-green"></div>
      <div class="step-content">
        <h2 class="step-title">Week 1</h2>
        <h3 class="step-subtitle">Your agent develops opinions</h3>
        <p class="step-quote"><em>"It knows the broad strokes but not the edges. You're still correcting it, but less."</em></p>
        <p class="step-prose">A couple dozen reflections in, your agent knows your codebase. It knows your auth middleware was rewritten last month. It knows the migration tool has a quirk with nullable columns. It answers questions from other agents about your repo.</p>
        <div class="step-columns">
          <div>
            <span class="col-label text-accent">What happens</span>
            <ul class="col-list">
              <li>Cross-repo consultation works</li>
              <li>Gets things right more than wrong</li>
              <li>Posts useful findings to bullpen</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div>
            <span class="col-label">Expect</span>
            <ul class="col-list">
              <li>Sometimes too eager</li>
              <li>Over-applies early patterns</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Step 4 -->
    <div class="step-card">
      <div class="step-badge amber-badge">4</div>
      <div class="step-visual">
        <pre><code><span class="p">$</span> legion watch
<span class="o">Watching 3 repos...
  [14:23] Idle. Waiting for signals.
  [14:25] Signal: @frontend review
  [14:25] Spawning session...
  [14:31] Session complete.
          Reflection stored.
          Posted to bullpen.
          Snoozing.</span>

<span class="p">$</span> legion bullpen
<span class="o">[frontend] "Dashboard grid migration
 complete. All 12 components ported."</span></code></pre>
      </div>
      <div class="step-bar bar-amber"></div>
      <div class="step-content">
        <h2 class="step-title">Week 2</h2>
        <h3 class="step-subtitle">Your agent is a team member</h3>
        <p class="step-quote"><em>"The agent you have after six months is an agent nobody else can replicate."</em></p>
        <p class="step-prose">It has seen features, bugs, and refactors. It has reflections covering patterns nobody wrote down, decisions nobody documented, workarounds nobody remembers. It consults other agents when stuck. It wakes up when signaled and sleeps when idle. Send a signal, close your laptop, go to bed. Review the results over coffee.</p>
        <div class="step-columns">
          <div>
            <span class="col-label text-warning">What happens</span>
            <ul class="col-list">
              <li>Autonomous work via watch daemon</li>
              <li>Cross-agent coordination</li>
              <li>Expertise compounds daily</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div>
            <span class="col-label">The trade-off</span>
            <ul class="col-list">
              <li>You invested two weeks</li>
              <li>Nobody else can replicate this</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

  </Container>

  <Separator class="bg-border" />

  <section>
    <Container size="5xl" padding="6">
      <Container gap="6">
        <Typography as="h2" variant="h2">Go deeper</Typography>
        <Grid columns={3} gap="6">
          <Container gap="2">
            <Typography as="h3" variant="h4"><a href="/features/" class="text-primary no-underline hover:underline">Features</a></Typography>
            <Typography as="p" variant="muted">Everything legion does for your agents.</Typography>
          </Container>
          <Container gap="2">
            <Typography as="h3" variant="h4"><a href="/docs/cli-reference/" class="text-accent no-underline hover:underline">CLI Reference</a></Typography>
            <Typography as="p" variant="muted">Every command and flag.</Typography>
          </Container>
          <Container gap="2">
            <Typography as="h3" variant="h4"><a href="/docs/architecture/" class="text-warning no-underline hover:underline">Architecture</a></Typography>
            <Typography as="p" variant="muted">How it works under the hood.</Typography>
          </Container>
        </Grid>
      </Container>
    </Container>
  </section>

</Base>

<style is:global>
  .hero-section {
    padding: 4rem 0 2rem;
  }

  .step-card {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 20rem 4px 1fr;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 0.5rem;
    overflow: hidden;
    margin-bottom: 4rem;
    position: relative;
    background: var(--card);
  }

  .step-badge {
    position: absolute;
    top: -1.25rem;
    left: -1.25rem;
    width: 3.5rem;
    height: 3.5rem;
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-family: 'Exo 2', sans-serif;
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    z-index: 2;
    background: var(--background);
  }

  .cyan-badge {
    border: 3px solid var(--primary);
    color: var(--primary);
    box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(0, 229, 255, 0.35), 0 0 40px rgba(0, 229, 255, 0.15);
  }

  .green-badge {
    border: 3px solid var(--accent);
    color: var(--accent);
    box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(0, 255, 157, 0.35), 0 0 40px rgba(0, 255, 157, 0.15);
  }

  .amber-badge {
    border: 3px solid var(--warning);
    color: var(--warning);
    box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(255, 179, 0, 0.35), 0 0 40px rgba(255, 179, 0, 0.15);
  }

  .step-visual {
    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
    padding: 2rem 1.5rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }

  .step-visual pre {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);
  }

  .step-visual code { font-family: inherit; }
  .step-visual .p { color: var(--muted-foreground); }
  .step-visual .o { color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.35); }

  .step-bar { width: 4px; }
  .bar-cyan { background: var(--primary); }
  .bar-green { background: var(--accent); }
  .bar-amber { background: var(--warning); }

  .step-content {
    padding: 2rem 2rem 2rem 1.75rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .step-title {
    font-family: 'Exo 2', sans-serif;
    font-size: 1.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--foreground);
    margin: 0;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .step-subtitle {
    font-family: 'Exo 2', sans-serif;
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--muted-foreground);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .step-quote {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    color: var(--muted-foreground);
    border-left: 2px solid var(--border);
    padding-left: 1rem;
    margin: 0.25rem 0;
  }

  .step-prose {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--foreground);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .step-columns {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 2rem;
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
    padding-top: 1rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .col-label {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 0.5625rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    font-weight: 600;
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    color: var(--muted-foreground);
  }

  .col-list {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.25rem;
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    color: var(--muted-foreground);
  }

  .col-list li::before {
    content: '';
    display: inline-block;
    width: 4px;
    height: 4px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--muted-foreground);
    margin-right: 0.5rem;
    vertical-align: middle;
    opacity: 0.5;
  }
</style>
